<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 350, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 350, Texas, won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason said it won $1.5 million of Harris Cty Municipal Utility Dist No. 350, Texas, general obligation Series 1996 bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.7243 percent.</p>
</text>
